  "description": {
    "en": "Handcrafted destination poster styled with layered wax crayons and colored pencil strokes on warm ivory paper.",
    "zh": "在暖象牙色纸上，用彩铅与蜡笔描绘目的地的建筑、文化符号和旅行记忆。"
  },
  "author": {
    "name": "simeon-sanai",
